# Tessera CODEOWNERS
#
# Maps paths to the people GitHub asks for review on pull requests. Code-owner review is
# not required today (branch protection: 0 approvals, code-owner review off), so this file
# only routes review requests. Turn on "Require review from Code Owners" when a second
# maintainer joins.
#
# Pattern matching follows .gitignore rules; later entries win.
# See https://docs.github.com/articles/about-code-owners

